The king said moreover to Shimei, 

          For though you would deny it, your own conscience accuses you for reviling and doing wrong to my father, (2Sa_16:5).
         Thou knowest all the wickedness which thine heart is privy to, that thou didst to David my father: therefore the LORD shall return thy wickedness upon thine own head;
